# Python
*whl
# ...but the vendored Pyodide wheels are runtime assets: jedi/parso drive editor
# autocompletion and pyflakes the lint. Ignoring them shipped a production site
# where completion silently did nothing while localhost worked.
!python/classroom/vendor/**/*.whl

# Tinmarino
donotgit/

# Teacher-only tooling. No secrets in it (the Cognito pool id and the bucket
# name are public identifiers that app.js exposes anyway), but it documents the
# setup and is of no use to a visitor. NOTE: gitignored means unbacked-up, so
# keep a copy somewhere if this machine dies.
python/classroom/admin/

# Superseded by Cognito: this held real AWS credentials encrypted under the
# shared class password. Never commit it again.
python/classroom/aws-config.enc.json
